The '''Symeong''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[Primate|ape]]-like<ref name="SWE">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> [[species]] who had large, sensitive [[ear]]s. The Symeong metalsmith [[Albrekh]], who worked aboard the [[Knights of Ren]]'s [[starship]] ''[[Night Buzzard]]'', used his ears to determine the heat of metal from the tone it produced when struck.<ref name="TROS VD" /> Another Symeong, [[Dathan (Symeong)|Dathan]], was a slave of the [[Sith Eternal]] who helped a [[Dathan|young]] [[Strand-Cast]] of [[Darth Sidious]] escape the planet [[Exegol]].<ref name="Shadow of the Sith">''[[Shadow of the Sith]]''</ref>

